/T (The timeline outlines key milestones for the development and implementation of the AI-Enabled Clinical Research Search Tool. It begins with the Project Kickoff Meeting, setting clear objectives and team roles. Following this, we will create a functional Prototype Release allowing for initial testing. The project will reach the Final Testing and Adjustments phase, ensuring the tool meets all criteria before the Launch Date. Post-launch, we will gather User Feedback to identify areas for improvement and enhancements based on stakeholder experiences and needs.)
